8:- Cell-scoped audio (US-057, `engine/audio/src/cell_audio.cpp`): `CellAudioSubscriber` releases a cell's voices on `on_unloaded`. Its owner is `cell_owner(coord)`, bit 63 set and nonzero, so it never matches a script owner. An emitter tags its voices with it.
9:- Audio (US-057, `engine/audio/`): the mixer (`mixer.cpp`) is offline and has no ECS or device access. `AudioEngine` serialises calls with one mutex, and the device thread takes it in `render()`. Voices carry an `OwnerId`; `stop_owner` releases them, and `ScriptEngine`'s destructor stops its own voices.
